{"seq":2,"slug":"mathematics","title":"高一数学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高一数学-简介\">高一数学 简介</h1><p>本 hub 收录高一（高中第一学年）数学必修课程的核心知识，按人教版新课标编排，覆盖三大板块：<a href=\"sets-logic/set-theory\">集合与逻辑</a>、<a href=\"functions/function-concept\">函数</a>、<a href=\"sequences/arithmetic-sequence\">数列</a>。它是整个高中数学体系的语言基石与思维起点——集合与逻辑提供&quot;说数学话&quot;的工具，函数建立变量关系的分析框架，数列引入离散与递推的思想，三者共同为高二的解析几何、导数、概率统计打底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>高一数学（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>集合·逻辑·函数·数列的概念建立与基本方法</td>\n<td>高中数学的入门与基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../year-2/mathematics\">高二数学</a></td>\n<td>解析几何、立体几何、导数初步、概率统计</td>\n<td>直接以本 hub 的函数、逻辑为前提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../year-3/mathematics\">高三数学</a></td>\n<td>综合复习、压轴题型、高考备考</td>\n<td>对本 hub 知识做综合与拔高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../science-track/mathematics-advanced\">理科数学（拓展）</a></td>\n<td>理科方向的加深内容</td>\n<td>在本 hub 基础上向竞赛/大学衔接延伸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../physics\">高一物理</a></td>\n<td>运动学、动力学、能量</td>\n<td>本 hub 的函数与三角函数是其数学工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../information-technology\">信息技术</a></td>\n<td>算法、编程、逻辑</td>\n<td>本 hub 的逻辑联结词对应其布尔运算与逻辑门</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>本 hub 只管&quot;高一必修的概念与方法&quot;</strong>——不涉及几何、导数、统计（那是高二），也不做高考综合套题（那是高三）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>严格建议<strong>按章节顺序</strong>学习，因为后一章依赖前一章：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>集合与逻辑</strong> → 2. <strong>函数</strong> → 3. <strong>数列</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>课内同步的高一学生</strong>：跟随教材进度逐章学习，每个知识点配合&quot;详细讲解&quot;中的例题与&quot;练习与思考&quot;做变式训练，重在理解概念而非刷题。先吃透<a href=\"sets-logic/set-theory\">集合论</a>的三大特性与运算，再进入<a href=\"functions/function-concept\">函数概念</a>的三要素与性质。</li>\n<li><strong>需要补基础的自学者 / 偏科学生</strong>：可优先攻克函数章——<a href=\"functions/function-concept\">函数概念</a> → <a href=\"functions/exponential-log\">指数与对数函数</a> → <a href=\"functions/trigonometric-functions\">三角函数</a>，这是高一失分最集中、对后续影响最大的部分；集合与逻辑章节较短，可快速过一遍。</li>\n<li><strong>提前预习的初升高学生</strong>：从<a href=\"sets-logic/set-theory\">集合论</a>入手感受&quot;从具体计算到抽象概念&quot;的思维转变，重点体会集合语言、充分必要条件这些初中没有的新内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>初中代数</strong>：整式与分式运算、一元二次方程、因式分解、不等式求解——这些是讨论函数定义域、值域和集合运算的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>初中函数初步</strong>：一次函数、二次函数、反比例函数的图像与性质，本 hub 在此之上引入函数的现代定义（集合对应观点）。</li>\n<li><strong>初中锐角三角函数</strong>：直角三角形中的正弦、余弦、正切定义，是<a href=\"functions/trigonometric-functions\">三角函数</a>推广到任意角的起点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与初中数学侧重计算技巧不同，高一开始要求理解概念本质、掌握从具体到抽象的思维，并能用逻辑推理组织论证——这是本 hub 最大的学习门槛，也是它的核心价值。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sets-logic","title":"集合与逻辑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"set-theory","title":"高一数学 — 集合论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/set-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logical-connectives","title":"高一数学 — 逻辑联结词","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/logical-connectives"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sufficient-necessary","title":"高一数学 — 充分必要条件","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sets-logic/sufficient-necessary"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"functions","title":"函数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"function-concept","title":"高一数学 — 函数概念与性质","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/function-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exponential-log","title":"高一数学 — 指数与对数函数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/exponential-log"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trigonometric-functions","title":"高一数学 — 三角函数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/functions/trigonometric-functions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"sequences","title":"数列","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sequences","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arithmetic-sequence","title":"高一数学 — 等差数列","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sequences/arithmetic-sequence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"geometric-sequence","title":"高一数学 — 等比数列","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sequences/geometric-sequence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sequence-applications","title":"高一数学 — 数列应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/mathematics/sequences/sequence-applications"}]}]}